servicesPage.russiaServicesText:
We assist Russian citizens and other persons based in Russia who need services in Cameroon and Central African countries. We do not organise tourist routes or trips. If a client is already in these countries or plans to travel there independently and needs help, we provide individual services:
• visa assistance;
• flight and hotel booking;
• car and vehicle rental;
• accommodation rental;
• guide and interpreter services;
• on-site accompaniment and payment for necessary services, meals and souvenirs in local currency.
